			(property "ow_note" "Forked from KiCad Power_Protection:USBLC6-2P6 to declare jumper_pin_groups 1/6 and 3/4, which are internally connected in the die. Pair it only with orb_weaver_smd:USBLC6-2P6_SOT-666, which carries the matching jumper_pad_groups. The two halves must stay together: with the generic Package_TO_SOT_SMD:SOT-666, DRC reports the unrouted pad of each pair as an unconnected item even when the copper is correct."
